格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness Codex Desktop — 无需预装环境、开箱即用的跨平台桌面客户端 · A ready-to-use cross-platform DeepSeek Harness desktop client with no environment setup","id":"gh:1333748978","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-codex-desktop","slug":"MichengAI/dsh-codex-desktop","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Codex Desktop — 无需预装环境、开箱即用的跨平台桌面客户端 · A ready-to-use cross-platform DeepSeek Harne"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ss desktop client with no environment setup"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Codex Desktop"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Download once. Open a ready-to-use local AI workspace.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"简体中文 · Download · Changelog · Report an issue"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> DSH Codex Desktop is a community-maintained desktop distribution of DeepSeek Harness. It is not an"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" official DeepSeek AI product."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"DSH Codex Desktop turns DeepSeek Harness into a native, ready-to-run desktop workbench. The installe"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"r includes the required Node.js runtime and local DSH runtime: install it, open it, then start worki"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ng. You do not need to prepare a Node.js environment or launch DSH from a terminal."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Download and start"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Get the current installer from GitHub Releases."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Platform | Package | Start here |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Windows x64 | `.exe` installer or `.zip` archive | Run the installer, then open **DSH Codex Deskto"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"p** from the Start menu. |\n| macOS Apple Silicon / Intel | `.dmg` installer | Open the disk image, m"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ove the app to Applications, then launch it. |\n| Linux x64 / ARM64 | `.AppImage` or Debian / Ubuntu "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"`.deb` | Run the package matching your CPU architecture, or install the deb package, then launch the"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"| Run the package matching your CPU architecture, or install the deb package, then launch the app. |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"1. Download the package for your platform.\n2. Install and open **DSH Codex Desktop**.\n3. Wait for th"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"e built-in local DSH service to finish starting.\n4. Create a task, select a model and permission mod"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"e, then work in your project."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The application keeps DSH data in your existing user profile (`%USERPROFILE%\\.dsh` on Windows), so s"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"essions and settings remain available after application upgrades."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## A complete desktop workbench"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Capability | What you get |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| **Desktop conversation workspace** | Project and task navigation, conversation sessions, model sel"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ection, permissions, session logs, and a focused desktop window. |\n| **Expert presets** | Enable spe"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"cialist roles for code review, architecture, frontend, backend, operations, and other workflows. |\n|"},{"id":"p15s4","text":" **Skill center** | Inspect, enable, disable, upload, and manage local and shared Agent skills from "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"Settings. |\n| **Archive management** | Search archived conversations, restore a session when needed,"},{"id":"p15s6","text":" or permanently remove archived records. |\n| **IM assistant** | Configure DingTalk, Feishu, Lark, We"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"Chat, WeCom, QQ, Telegram, and other available channels in one place. |\n| **Plugin market** | Discov"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"er, install, update, enable, and diagnose DSH plugins without leaving the desktop client. |\n| **Sche"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"duled automation** | Use the built-in DSH scheduling capability to manage recurring tasks from the s"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"ame workspace. |\n| **Safe local runtime** | The app starts DSH on a validated loopback address and k"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"eeps the browser UI inside the desktop shell. |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Product preview"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Explore the desktop workspace, light-theme settings, and plugin management pages. The home screen an"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"d 11 settings and plugin screenshots come from the newly supplied desktop captures; the conversation"},{"id":"p17s3","text":", context, and sidebar previews are retained from earlier captures. Plugin versions, counts, and sta"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"tes reflect each capture. Click any image to view it at its original resolution."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Home: project navigation, task entry points, and composer."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Conversation: messages, trajectory, context, and task input."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Appearance and desktop pets (2 screenshots)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Light-theme settings: permissions, language, appearance, and editor preferences."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Pet settings: choose a companion, manage custom pets, and adjust size."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Our plugin pages (6 screenshots)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Expert presets: filter, search, and enable specialist roles."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Skill management: manage local Agent Skills across sources."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Scheduled automation: examples, task schedules, and run history access."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"IM assistant: manage messaging channels, accounts, and incoming messages."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Archived conversations: filter by project, search, and restore past chats."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Codex UI settings: feature overview and companion plugin installation status."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Community plugin pages (4 screenshots)"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Context settings"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Sidebar settings"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Plugin market: discover community plugins and inspect installation and update status."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Included on first launch"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The installer ships with the local runtime required to start DSH. On first launch, it prepares the d"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"esktop-facing community plugins in the Web profile:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Included capability | Package |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| Codex-style workspace UI | `@michengai/dsh-codex-ui` |\n| Native desktop pet and conversation notif"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ications | `@michengai/dsh-codex-pet` |\n| Expert preset management | `@michengai/dsh-agency-agents` "},{"id":"p37s3","text":"|\n| Skill management | `@michengai/dsh-skills-manager` |\n| Archive management | `@michengai/dsh-arch"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"ive-manager` |\n| IM assistant | `@michengai/dsh-im-connect` |\n| Scheduled automation | `@michengai/d"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"sh-automation` |\n| Extensible workspace sidebar | `dsh-better-sidebar` |\n| One-off read-only side qu"},{"id":"p37s6","text":"estions | `@michengai/dsh-btw` |\n| Code simplification scoped to Git changes | `@michengai/dsh-simpl"},{"id":"p37s7","text":"ify` |\n| Retry, diagnose, and verify after failures | `@michengai/dsh-pua` |\n| Independent Agent cod"},{"id":"p37s8","text":"e review | `@michengai/dsh-code-review` |\n| Plugin market | `dshmarket` |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## System requirements"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Item | Requirement |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| Operating system | Windows 10/11, macOS, or Linux |\n| Architecture | Windows x64, macOS arm64/x64,"},{"id":"p41s2","text":" or Linux x64/arm64 |\n| Node.js | Not required for end users; bundled with the application |\n| Netwo"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"rk | Required only for the model providers, plugin downloads, and tools you choose to use |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Privacy and security"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- DSH configuration, sessions, and credentials remain in the current user's DSH directory. Uninstall"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"ing the desktop app does not delete them.\n- The launcher accepts only validated `127.0.0.1` local HT"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"TP addresses for its embedded window.\n- External HTTP(S) links open in the system browser. File, Jav"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"aScript, and data URLs are blocked.\n- Electron uses context isolation and sandboxing, with Node.js i"},{"id":"p43s5","text":"ntegration disabled for the DSH page.\n- Your configured model providers and DSH tools may make their"},{"id":"p43s6","text":" own network requests. Review their settings and privacy policies before use."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
